      "detailed_description": "Ball Torture is a thrilling 2D puzzle game that puts you in control of a bowling ball on a daring mission to escape from a recycling compartment. In this challenging adventure, players must guide the rolling ball through a series of intricate levels filled with hazardous obstacles, including sharp saws and other treacherous traps.<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenging Puzzle Gameplay: Ball Torture offers intricate and challenging puzzles, requiring players to navigate through various obstacles and hazards to reach the checkpoints.<br></li><li>Intuitive Ball Control: Players can effortlessly control the bowling ball's movement using their cursor, providing a smooth and responsive gaming experience.<br></li><li>30 Checkpoints to Conquer: The game features 30 carefully designed checkpoints, serving as significant milestones for players to overcome in their quest for freedom.<br></li><li>Competitive Element: Players can compete against themselves, striving to beat their personal best times and enhance their skills, fostering a competitive and rewarding environment.<br></li><li>Star Collection System: As players progress through the game, they can accumulate stars, symbolizing their achievements and showcasing their prowess to the gaming community.</li></ul>",
      "about_the_game": "Ball Torture is a thrilling 2D puzzle game that puts you in control of a bowling ball on a daring mission to escape from a recycling compartment. In this challenging adventure, players must guide the rolling ball through a series of intricate levels filled with hazardous obstacles, including sharp saws and other treacherous traps.<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenging Puzzle Gameplay: Ball Torture offers intricate and challenging puzzles, requiring players to navigate through various obstacles and hazards to reach the checkpoints.<br></li><li>Intuitive Ball Control: Players can effortlessly control the bowling ball's movement using their cursor, providing a smooth and responsive gaming experience.<br></li><li>30 Checkpoints to Conquer: The game features 30 carefully designed checkpoints, serving as significant milestones for players to overcome in their quest for freedom.<br></li><li>Competitive Element: Players can compete against themselves, striving to beat their personal best times and enhance their skills, fostering a competitive and rewarding environment.<br></li><li>Star Collection System: As players progress through the game, they can accumulate stars, symbolizing their achievements and showcasing their prowess to the gaming community.</li></ul>",
      "short_description": "Ball Torture is an exciting 2D puzzle game where you control a bowling ball, trying to escape from the recycling compartment. Overcome sharp saws and other obstacles, reach 30 checkpoints, and collect stars to become the winner among the balls in the recycling compartment!",
